Four in a line makes a line blaster; an L or T makes a bomb; a square makes a homing dart; five in a line makes a colour bomb. Tap a special or combine two for a bigger clear.

Complete the goals shown on the board. The board finishes as soon as they are met, and leftover moves become line blasters that add to your score. Hard, Super Hard and Boss boards change the challenge along the Journey.

The current iOS game awards stars from the board’s score thresholds. Matches, specials, cascades and the leftover-move finish contribute to the score. The browser demo keeps its earlier move-target star rule.

